Package: whatran
Type: Package
Title: Record What Ran: Steps, Claims and Evidence of an Analysis
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Junhao", "Qiu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A thin R interface to the whatran recorder. Wraps code in recorded
    steps, records claims and rejections, and runs commands with captured
    evidence. All calls go through the whatran command line, so the ledger,
    the writing rules and the graph are the same for every language.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: python3 and whatran (pip install whatran) or a project with analysis/whatran.py
